# =============================================================================
# Company-specific / proprietary information — NEVER upload to public GitHub
# =============================================================================
# This repo (CTObot) is public and MIT-licensed. Anything that is specific to
# our company, customers, employees, or infrastructure belongs in the ignored
# folder below — not in AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, docs/, or skills/.
# Ignore everything inside company_proprietary/ EXCEPT its generic README
# (which documents the public/private convention and names nothing company-specific).
company_proprietary/*
!company_proprietary/README.md

# Belt-and-suspenders: also block common names people reach for by mistake.
company-proprietary/
company_private/
proprietary/
private/
internal/
*.private.md

# Secrets and credentials — never commit these to any repo, public or private.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
secrets.*
*secret*.json
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local, machine-specific tool settings (not for the public repo)
.claude/settings.local.json
**/settings.local.json
